                                "example_id": "8d0b0689-c740-4cdb-bc58-f0d7f2546b0f",
                                "sense_id": "00b39b73-b41e-30d3-8e1a-211d30a4d0ee",
                                "text": "But, Rhyanon, all I want to do, is to build a rapport,\nAnd that's when you call me, a fat smurf whore.\n\"Useless fuckwipe, a pudley, a chud and a sackashit,\nGreen card cunt, snarling wolverine bitch,\" you throw a fit.",
                                "translation": "但是，Rhyanon，我只想建立良好的關係，\n而那時妳卻叫我胖藍色小精靈婊子。\n「沒用的廢物、矮冬瓜、噁心鬼和一坨屎，\n綠卡賤貨、咆哮的金鋼狼臭婊子，」妳大發脾氣。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab698994-5d48-4be8-bd5e-5b5827d62101",
                                "sense_id": "00b39b73-b41e-30d3-8e1a-211d30a4d0ee",
                                "text": "At least you don't have to be a fugly fuckheaded chud who's bad at math!",
                                "translation": "至少你不用當個數學很爛、醜到爆又腦殘的噁心鬼！"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09116c39-b4e1-439c-a4c5-dea1211262b1",
                                "sense_id": "00b39b73-b41e-30d3-8e1a-211d30a4d0ee",
                                "text": "How fucking hedious^([sic]) of a chud must this guy be in order for him to feel that mug shot is a positive representation?",
                                "translation": "這傢伙到底得是個多麼他媽醜陋的噁心鬼，才會覺得那張檔案照是正面的形象？"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e274e7a-297e-4a9f-9a33-a34f16ca10d2",
                                "sense_id": "00b39b73-b41e-30d3-8e1a-211d30a4d0ee",
                                "text": "Lower your standards far enough and always remember to double wrap and even a chud like me got some on a regular basis when I lived there.",
                                "translation": "只要把你的標準降得夠低，而且永遠記得戴兩層套子，就算是我這種醜男，住在那裡的時候也能有穩定的性生活。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfabea31-65c8-42d7-af99-82ac01d1b4f6",
                                "sense_id": "00b39b73-b41e-30d3-8e1a-211d30a4d0ee",
                                "text": "SDCC is crowded enough without a few hundred more chuds in rascal scooters cutting in line and taking up space on the public walkways because they heard the cast of The Big Bang Theory was going to be here or something.",
                                "translation": "聖地牙哥國際漫畫展（SDCC）已經夠擠了，不需要再多出幾百個騎著老年代步車的怪咖插隊並佔據公共走道，只因為他們聽說《生活大爆炸》的演員會來這裡之類的。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3fba04a5-130a-3487-ba92-cc3b2230ca0d",
                        "entry_id": "71549d36-4c61-3c92-8bff-f6704e0522ed",
                        "glosses": [
                            "通常指持有被視為反動的社會政治觀點的人，多為男性"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "62454738-2163-44ac-b0c2-1cafc547f378",
                                "sense_id": "3fba04a5-130a-3487-ba92-cc3b2230ca0d",
                                "text": "Some chud on Twitter said The Wall Street Journal was liberal propaganda.",
                                "translation": "推特上有個右翼分子說《華爾街日報》是自由派的政治宣傳。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "134fd1a0-fea3-4cb9-968c-239b363f4071",
                                "sense_id": "3fba04a5-130a-3487-ba92-cc3b2230ca0d",
                                "text": "Unlike all those cuckservatives in Congress, this guy's a true chud.",
                                "translation": "不像國會裡那些綠帽保守派，這傢伙是個真正的保守派男子漢。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3ff9f51b-0af1-33b5-8d9a-56938f01093a",
                        "entry_id": "71549d36-4c61-3c92-8bff-f6704e0522ed",
                        "glosses": [
                            "討人厭或反社會的人；失敗者，魯蛇"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet",
                            "attributive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e93b53a-3928-4b5f-8b07-58627aa82769",
                                "sense_id": "3ff9f51b-0af1-33b5-8d9a-56938f01093a",
                                "text": "My little chud brother plays video games all day.",
                                "translation": "我那個討人厭的弟弟整天都在打電動。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
